(1329, 1, 'App\\Models\\Page', 3, 'updated', '{\"old\":{\"body_eng\":\"<p>Hello<\\/p>\",\"body_hindi\":\"<p>History<\\/p>\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-09-19T04:03:22.000000Z\"},\"new\":{\"body_eng\":\"<p style=\\\"language: en-IN; margin-top: 5.28pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-indent: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-line-break-override: none; word-break: normal; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 22.0pt; font-family: \'Tw Cen MT Condensed\'; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Tw Cen MT Condensed\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Calibri Light\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Calibri Light\'; color: black; mso-color-index: 13; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; language: en-US; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: dark1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;\\\">The <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 22.0pt; font-family: \'Tw Cen MT Condensed\'; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Tw Cen MT Condensed\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Calibri Light\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Calibri Light\'; color: black; mso-color-index: 13; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; language: en-US; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: dark1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;\\\">GoUK<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 22.0pt; font-family: \'Tw Cen MT Condensed\'; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Tw Cen MT Condensed\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Calibri Light\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Calibri Light\'; color: black; mso-color-index: 13; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; language: en-US; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: dark1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;\\\"> has implemented the World Bank assisted Uttarakhand Disaster Recovery Project (UDRP) and Additional Financing (AF) since 2013. UDRP-AF, which closed in September 2023.<\\/span><\\/