l-alpha: 100.0%;\\\">The <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 22.0pt; font-family: \'Tw Cen MT Condensed\'; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Tw Cen MT Condensed\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Calibri Light\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Calibri Light\'; color: black; mso-color-index: 13; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; language: en-US; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: dark1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;\\\">GoUK<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size: 22.0pt; font-family: \'Tw Cen MT Condensed\'; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Tw Cen MT Condensed\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Calibri Light\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Calibri Light\'; color: black; mso-color-index: 13; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; language: en-US; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: dark1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;\\\"> has implemented the World Bank assisted Uttarakhand Disaster Recovery Project (UDRP) and Additional Financing (AF) since 2013. UDRP-AF, which closed in September 2023.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"language: en-IN; margin-top: 5.28pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-indent: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-line-break-override: none; word-break: normal; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p style=\\\"language: en-IN; margin-top: 5.28pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; text-indent: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; mso-line-break-override: none; word-break: normal; punctuation-wrap: hanging;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 22.0pt; font-family: \'Tw Cen MT Condensed\'; mso-ascii-font-family: \'Tw Cen MT Condensed\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Calibri Light\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Calibri Light\'; color: black; mso-color-index: 13; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; language: en-US; mso-style-textfill-type: solid; mso-style-textfill-fill-themecolor: dark1; mso-style-textfill-fill-color: black; mso-style-textfill-fill-alpha: 100.0%;\\\">The project covered the restoration of housing and rural connectivity (roads, bridges &amp; slope protection work), River bank protection works, built the resilience of communities, and increased the capacity of the State to respond to emergencies. <\\/span><\\/p>\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-11-18 10:30:03\"}}', '103.116.26.221', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64; rv:145.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/145.0', 'https://www.u-prepare.com/admin/pages/edit/3', '2025-11-18 05:00:03', '2025-11-18 05:00:03', NULL, NULL),
