(17314, 1, 'App\\Models\\BoqEntryData', 3971, 'created', '{\"new\":{\"sub_package_project_id\":\"45\",\"sl_no\":\"39\",\"item_description\":\"Providing and Fixing \'Logo\' of Project\\nProviding and fixing of typical informatory sign board with Logo as per MORD specifications and drawing. Three MS Plates of 1.6 mm thick, top and middle plate duly welded with MS flat iron 25mm x 5m size on back on edges. The lower plate will be welded with MS angle iron frame of 25mm x 25mm x 5mm. The angle iron frame of the lower most plate and flat iron frame of middle plate will be welded to 2 nos. 75mm x 75 mm of 12 SWG sheet tubes posts duly embedded in cement concrete M-15 grade blocks of 450mm x 450mm x 600mm, 600mm below ground level. The top most diamond plate will be welded to middle plate by 47mmx 47mm of 12 SWG steel plate tube. All M.S. will be stove enameled on both sides. Lettering and printing arrows, border etc. will be painted with ready mixed synthetic enamel paint of superior quality in required shade and colour. All sections of framed posts and steel tube will be painted with primer and two coats of epoxy paint as per drawing Clause 1701 and Annexure 1700.1 and as directed by engineer in charge.\",\"unit\":\"No\",\"qty\":2,\"rate\":16900,\"amount\":33800,\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-04 14:35:13\",\"created_at\":\"2026-02-04 14:35:13\",\"id\":3971}}', '103.113.38.178', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', 'https://u-prepare.com/admin/boqentry/upload', '2026-02-04 14:35:13', '2026-02-04 14:35:13', NULL, NULL),
