(2489, 37, '1.36', 'Excavation in Hilly Areas in Ordinary Rock by mechanical means not requiring blasting (With out Dozer)\nExcavation in hilly area in ordinary rock not requiring blasting by mechanical means without using Dozer including cutting and trimming of slopes and disposal of cut material with a lift upto 1.5 m and lead upto 20 m at safe place as per direction of ingineer in-charge and as per Clause 1603.2.', 'Cum', 57.400, 114.00, 6543.60, '2025-10-16 11:07:46', '2025-10-16 11:07:46', NULL),
