(2497, 37, '1.44', 'Type - A, \"W\" : Metal Beam Crash Barrier\nProviding and erecting a \"W\" metal beam crash barrier comprising of 3 mm thick corrugated sheet metal beam rail, 70 cm above road/ground level, fixed on ISMC series channel vertical post, 150 x 75 x 5 mm spaced 2 m centre to centre, 1.8 m high, 1.1 m below ground/road level, all steel parts and fitments to be galvanised by hot dip process, all fittings to conform to IS:1367 and IS:1364, metal beam rail to be fixed on the vertical post with a spacer of channel section 150 x 75 x 5 mm, 330 mm long complete as per clause 810 ( if Concrete Required for Vertical post Fixing will be paid extra) and as directed by engineer in-charge. ', 'Rmt.', 100.000, 3941.00, 394100.00, '2025-10-16 11:07:46', '2025-10-16 11:07:46', NULL),
